{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01630","headline":"杂曲歌辞 妾薄命 · 武平一","name":"杂曲歌辞 妾薄命","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有女妖且丽，裴回湘水湄。\n水湄兰杜芳，采之将寄谁。\n瓠犀发皓齿，双蛾嚬翠眉。\n红脸如开莲，素肤若凝脂。\n绰约多逸态，轻盈不自持。\n常矜绝代色，复恃倾城姿。\n子夫前入侍，飞燕复当时。\n正悦掌中舞，宁哀团扇诗。\n洛川昔云遇，高唐今尚违。\n幽合禽雀噪，闲阶草露滋。\n流景一何速，年华不可追。\n解佩安何赠，怨咽空自悲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武平一","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01630.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01630","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}